OL,3,GNEWSA'A rogue roofer swindled us out of
OL,4,A#8,500'                                
OL,6,FA Kent pensioner has welcomed the      
OL,7,F28-month prison sentence of a rogue    
OL,8,Ftrader who swindled her out of #8,500  
OL,9,Fand damaged her roof.                  
OL,11,FJennifer and Bernard Gilbert, from     
OL,12,FGillingham, said Billy Beaney          
OL,13,Fcold-called at their home of 56 years  
OL,14,Fin November 2025, telling them a roof  
OL,15,Ftile was damaged.                      
OL,17,FThe 29-year-old then offered to carry  
OL,18,Fout the work for free in return for a  
OL,19,Frecommendation on his website. But     
OL,20,Fafter he started, he claimed there were
OL,21,Fproblems which would cost #26,000 to   
OL,22,Ffix.                                   
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
